# Cognis Group

Last updated: 2026-08-25

> Cognis Group helps organisations decide where AI can help, train their people and build safe tools for everyday work. Three practices: AI Strategy & Advisory, AI Training & Workforce Development, and AI Agent & Automation Engineering. Quod Tango Muto: what we touch, we change.

