## Products

Beyond advisory, Cognis Group builds and operates its own software. Four products:

- [Products overview](https://cognis.group/products/): The software Cognis Group builds and runs.
- [Cognis AI](https://ai.cognis.group): Specialised AI support for customer service, voice calls, company knowledge, operations or trade. People check its work before it takes on more responsibility. Tagline: "Hire AI to do the work." (Live)
- [MarketSage](https://www.marketsage.africa): A marketing and sales tool that researches prospects, helps plan campaigns and shows which activity creates sales opportunities. Tagline: "Marketing that thinks, acts, and converts." (Live)
- [Migratio](https://migratio.cognis.group): A tool that helps banks, ministries and regulated organisations move data safely, check it before the change and keep a record of every step. (Live)
- [SPOG](https://spog.cognis.group): One dashboard for IT, networks, facilities, vehicles and security, with every number linked to its source. (Live)

